      "description": "Start date: 2024-08-14\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nPart time\n\nAmerican University is a student-centered research institution located in Washington, DC, with highly-ranked schools and colleges, internationally-renowned faculty, and a reputation for creating meaningful change in the world. Learn more about American University Department: Kogod School of Business Time Type: Part time Job Description: The Department of Marketing at the Kogod School of Business is renowned for pioneering research in consumer behavior, with a particular emphasis on public policy relevance in Washington, DC. Our innovative facilities, including a new Behavioral Research Lab, provide an ideal environment for innovative exploration. Through our comprehensive education programs, we prepare students for diverse and dynamic careers in marketing. We are seeking qualified individuals to join our team as adjunct professorial lecturers in the field of Marketing to contribute to our mission of delivering quality education and academic excellence at American University. Responsibilities Course Instruction: Deliver engaging and effective instruction in one or more courses within the business curriculum. Develop course syllabi and materials, including lecture notes, assignments, and assessments, to ensure alignment with program objectives and industry standards. Student Engagement: Foster an inclusive and supportive learning environment conducive to student success. Provide guidance, feedback, and mentorship to students to enhance their understanding of course concepts and their overall academic growth. Staying Current: Stay abreast of current trends, research, and best practices in the field of business. Participate in professional development activities such as giving presentations and attending conferences to support your content area and enhance teaching effectiveness. Administrative Duties: Fulfill administrative responsibilities associated with teaching, including grade 